    "statement": "CEK-TA 只定义 Memory Contract，不保存外接项目私有记忆",
    "normalized_claim": "phase43.cek_ta_memory_contract.v1",
    "claim_type": "boundary",
    "memory_layer_role": "boundary",
    "evidence_summary": "LangChain documents short-term and long-term memory concepts, including LangGraph long-term memories stored as JSON documents under namespaces and keys.；LangChain documents long-term memory across conversations, based on LangGraph stores organized by namespace and key.；OWASP recommends validating and sanitizing data before storing agent memory, isolating memory, setting expiration and size limits, auditing sensitive data, and using cryptographic integrity checks.",
    "interpretation_notes": "本候选只沉淀外接项目 AI Memory Layer 的治理契约；不保存外接项目私有记忆，不创建真实数据库，不绑定单一 vendor。",
    "claim_strength": "medium",
    "performance_claim": false
  },
  "applicability": {
    "market": "general",
